      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=2em> <b>How To Play:</b></size>\n\n\n1. Each Stage will require
    an item that can be produced by combining shapes.\n\n2. Follow the combination
    guide to successfully create the shape!\n\n3. Drag and Drop one Shape to Another
    to Trigger a Combination. \n\n4. Keep combining until you get the required shape.\n\n5.
    Have fun and enjoy the game. \n\n\n<i><align=center>Touch the Screen to Close
    the Prompts.</align></i>"
